{"id":"544260314","kind":"article","title":"情景体验增强了叙述的力量","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zhZFC1LFDwAcsgJAdaKEDnSHyrf1bR954Ssb"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"助记媒介 & 思想工具","date":"2022-07-21","updated":"2024-05-18","votes":5,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":431,"keywords":["叙事体验","互动设计","电子游戏","学习投入","认知脚手架"],"summary":"译文认为，叙事能调动情感并帮助理解；当故事通过玩家的行动被“演绎”出来时，情景体验会进一步增强读者与作者意图的联系。作者以《传送门》《生化奇兵》和《最终幻想》作对比，强调叙事若融入互动过程，会更像玩家行动的结果，而非与体验分离的电影。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/544260314","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"lqBZa-P9\">叙述很强大。叙述能引人投入情感，助人理解（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zvHfreBts9DHWRtztZihrGKuPsP5j8LSPLQn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">文本的叙述作为认知脚手架</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>）。若让叙述成为<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3KASfpz5AmNmqM2m517Jbs1EvXrLN7NkeYWH\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情景体验</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>，其力量会进一步增强，因为<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6rE2jCvARneUxogtFCTMafzJvYEKWFgb51c2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情景体验可以创造出个人与作者意图的强烈联系</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>。</p><p data-pid=\"MYz93dAg\">例如，在《传送门》和《生化奇兵》中，游戏环境，角色出场，各种交互中贯彻着一条令人难忘的叙述线。相比《最终幻想》，其故事在很大程度上与游玩体验分离，更像一部电影，这两部游戏的叙述感觉是作为玩家行动的结果而出现的。</p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"ediz6JKm\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"698476935\" href=\"#/post/698476935\">§赋能环境、游戏和《启蒙琼林》</a></li><li data-pid=\"8sNyueoM\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"458337989\" href=\"#/post/458337989\">赋能环境</a></li><li data-pid=\"yC7gKAFv\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"458799119\" href=\"#/post/458799119\">文本的叙述作为认知脚手架</a></li><li data-pid=\"SABo6b9R\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"656108634\" href=\"#/post/656108634\">情景体验可以创造出个人与作者意图的强烈联系</a></li><li data-pid=\"y4RUF5p6\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"695665750\" href=\"#/post/695665750\">《启蒙琼林》是一场巨型情景体验</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"a1kSLiu9\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"6TvUp4Ep\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zhZFC1LFDwAcsgJAdaKEDnSHyrf1bR954Ssb\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Enacted experiences amplify the power of narrative (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 文本的叙述作为认知脚手架 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"458799119\" href=\"#/post/458799119\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 情景体验 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"463926133\" href=\"#/post/463926133\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 情景体验可以创造出个人与作者意图的强烈联系 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"656108634\" href=\"#/post/656108634\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"544144484","title":"助记媒介对下游学习的影响","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":5,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"547457170","title":"助记媒介如何能适应不同的背景和目标的读者？","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":7,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"698476935","title":"§赋能环境、游戏和《启蒙琼林》","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":9,"minutes":6,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"695665750","title":"《启蒙琼林》是一场巨型情景体验","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":6,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"656108634","title":"情景体验可以创造出个人与作者意图的强烈联系","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":5,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[]}